{
  "description": "a 2×3 rectangle with one side on the axis and a 1×1 notch cut in from the axis, revolved about z: in a full turn the notch closes into a void of the one lump — the profile's two chains of segments off the axis, the outer one spanning the other, each a shell — and in a quarter turn it opens onto the flat ends, one shell",
